  "_doc": "The prop lab's bench (docs/briefs/prop-lab.md): each kit prop against the breakage lab's set (revolver and shotgun at 5 m, dynamite at 1, 3 and 6 m, a limp man dropped on it from 1 m), fire, and for chairs a seated man whose chair is shot or kicked from under him. Positions in the prop's space (origin on the floor, facing +Z). 'seated': a Studio man sits in it first. 'event' do: shoot (weapon, from, at_member, height: aimed at the member that high above the floor, else its middle), dynamite (at: the stick on the floor), kick (at_member, height above the floor, impulse N*s), drop_man, burn (ignite: members). Edit to add scenarios. 'prop': '' runs the floor alone (a baseline for frame times). 'glass': kit props that shatter (or loose ones: the spittoon, the cup) put on it ([{id, at, lit}]); 'at_glass' shoots one (do kick_glass kicks one, impulse N*s) (height: aimed that far up it). Full barrels (whiskey_barrel, water_barrel, oil_barrel: PropContents) report their 'contents' (left, out, leaks, released). 'stack': more kit props stood on it or beside it ([{id, at, yaw}]: crates, barrels).",
